<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending Sept 14, 1996, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  9-14-96		 375,000	    247.6</p>
<p>week ending:  9-7-96		  301,000	    247.2</p>
<p>year ago:     9-16-1995	     344,000	    244.6</p>
